 Version←{
⍝ Returns Konducata version from VERSION file
⍝ ⍵: optional path to repo root (default: current #.Home)
     path←{0=⎕NC'⍵':'' ⋄ ⍵}⍵
     :If 0=≢path
     :AndIf 9=#.⎕NC'Home'
         path←#.Home
     :EndIf
     vfile←path,'VERSION'
     :If ⎕NEXISTS vfile
         ⊃⎕NGET vfile 1
     :Else
         'unknown'
     :EndIf
 }
